      "handle": "@unknown_42",
      "avatar": "https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=12",
      "text": "I wrote something I could never say out loud. Somehow it feels lighter now that a stranger might read it.",
      "image": "https://picsum.photos/seed/saved-post1/900/600",
      "saved_at": "2026-09-25T08:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_002",
      "name": "Half Light",
      "handle": "@between_worlds",
      "avatar": "https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=36",
      "text": "There's a specific kind of loneliness that only exists in the space between two people who used to know each other. You become strangers wearing familiar faces.",
      "image": null,
      "saved_at": "2026-09-23T22:14:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "post_003",
      "name": "Wandering Ink",
      "handle": "@ghost_ink",
      "avatar": "https://i.pravatar.cc/150?img=5",
      "text": "The best thing about being anonymous? You can tell the truth without losing anyone.",
